            "rationale": "The change adds no new effect. The new Tier 2 functions (allocation, settledFines, the Paid record) are pure computations over Library. Tier 3 Views only projects the results, and the CLI only renders view models. The `DateTime.Today` read in Payments.pay is an unchanged context line that already existed in the base code, so it does not count against this change.",
