              }
            ],
            "rationale": "The fact 'a fine is paid in full when payments cover its whole amount' is defined in Tier 2 (settledFines) and copied as a literal predicate in Tier 3 (Views.account). The copies currently agree, but each one is authoritative for a different output: the `pay` settled list versus the `account` status. The allocation itself has a single definition.",
